---
canonical:
  title: Dao De Jing 75
  author: Laozi
  language: eng
  translator: Stephen Mitchell
  source: "https://terebess.hu/english/tao/mitchell.html#Kap75"
  text: |
    When taxes are too high,
    people go hungry.
    When the government is too intrusive,
    people lose their spirit.

    Act for the people's benefit.
    Trust them; leave them alone.
original:
  title: 道德經・第七十五章
  author: 老子
  language: lzh
  text: |
    民之饥,以其上食税之多,是以饥。
    民之难治,以其上之有为,是以难治。
    民之轻死,以其上求生之厚,是以轻死。
    夫唯无以生为者,是贤于贵生。

